B.blt=new A.aH("Data Handling & Protection","# Data Handling and Protection Policy\n\n**Effective Date:** February 2025  \n**Company:** Red Domino Precision Pilot\n\n## 1. Purpose\n\nThis policy describes how Red Domino Precision Pilot collects, stores, processes, and protects personal and business data within the Precision Pilot application.\n\n## 2. Data Classification\n\n### 2.1 Highly Sensitive\n- **TIN (Tax ID):** Encrypted at rest; displayed only as last 4 digits; required for 1099 when pay \u2265 $600\n- **Passwords:** Hashed by Firebase Auth; never stored in plain text\n- **CDL numbers:** Stored securely; access restricted to authorized personnel\n\n### 2.2 Sensitive\n- Address, phone, date of birth, emergency contact\n- Access limited to owner and the driver themselves\n\n### 2.3 Business Data\n- CPM rates, settlements, load data, truck assignments\n- Access by role (owner vs. driver)\n\n## 3. Collection Practices\n\n- **Minimal collection:** We collect only what is necessary for operations\n- **Purpose limitation:** Data is used only for stated purposes (settlements, tax, fleet management)\n- **Driver consent:** Sensitive driver data is collected during profile setup with explicit explanation\n\n## 4. Storage and Security\n\n- **Cloud provider:** Firebase (Google Cloud Platform)\n- **Encryption:** TLS in transit; encryption at rest (Firestore, Storage)\n- **Access control:** Firestore security rules enforce role-based access\n- **Authentication:** Multi-factor options (password, biometrics, magic link)\n\n## 5. Access Control\n\n- **Owners:** Full access to fleet data (drivers, trucks, loads, settlements)\n- **Drivers:** Access only to their own profile, loads, and assigned truck\n- **System:** Custom claims (role, driverId, truckId) enforce isolation\n\n## 6. Data Retention\n\n| Data Type | Retention |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| Settlement/pay records | 7 years (tax compliance) |\n| Driver profile | While active + 7 years post-termination |\n| Usage logs | 90 days |\n| Invite tokens | 7 days, then invalidated |\n\n## 7. Data Sharing\n\n- No sale of personal data\n- Sharing only with: (1) service providers (Firebase) under contract, (2) legal requirement, (3) your consent\n\n## 8. Incident Response\n\nIn the event of a data breach, we will:\n1. Contain and assess the incident\n2. Notify affected individuals and regulators as required by law\n3. Take steps to prevent recurrence\n\n## 9. Your Rights\n\nYou may request access, correction, or deletion of your data. Contact your fleet manager or company administrator.\n\n## 10. Updates\n\nThis policy may be updated. Material changes will be communicated via the app.\n")
